            oa:hasSelector [ a oa:TextQuoteSelector ;
                oa:exact "Replica lag. Somewhere between thirty seconds and four minutes depending on the migration job. So a reporting number can be four minutes stale during a cutover. My argument is that a four-minute-stale number is fine and an outage is not." ;
