        oa:hasTarget [ a oa:SpecificResource ;
            oa:hasSource narr:Sample_1HalyardWeekly20260908 ;
            oa:hasSelector [ a oa:TextQuoteSelector ;
                oa:exact "Because if we take ownership at site one, we've got two sites on our reference data and two on theirs, and the zone map drifts between them. You find that out from a mis-priced consignment three weeks later. Keeping one source of truth through the whole programme is worth more than getting ownership early." ;
