        oa:hasTarget [ a oa:SpecificResource ;
            oa:hasSource narr:Sample_1HalyardWeekly20260908 ;
            oa:hasSelector [ a oa:TextQuoteSelector ;
                oa:exact "I agree with that, and I'd add: it also means the vendor can't tell the steering group that their reference data was fine and ours broke it. Their data, their problem, right up until the end." ;
